Setup			3D_01rH

### Disk parameters

AspectRatio     	0.05            Thickness over Radius in the disc
Sigma0			1.0 		Surface Density at r=1
SigmaSlope		1.0		Slope of the surface density
FlaringIndex		0.25		Flare of the disk
ALPHA               1.0e-2
Beta                1.0
Gamma               1.4

### Dust parameters

Invstokes1		10.0   Inverse of the Stokes number for dust1
Epsilon                 0.01    Dust-to-gas mass ratio
DUSTFLOOR       1.0e-6

### Floor parameters (Athena++-style)
GASFLOOR         1.0e-7     Absolute gas density floor
ENERGYFLOOR      1.0e-10    Energy floor for adiabatic EOS
DUST_PERCENT_FLOOR  0.0    Dust percent floor (0 = disabled)
DUST_TVCAP_FLAG     0      Enable terminal-velocity cap (0=off, 1=on)
DUST_TVCAP_FACTOR   2.0    TV-cap multiplier (Athena default 2.0)
DUST_TVCAP_D2G_MAX  1.0e-3  Max dust-to-gas ratio for TV-cap trigger
DUST_TVCAP_RHO_FLOOR_FACTOR  2.0e4  Rho floor factor for D2G gating (Athena default 2e4)
DUST_TVCAP_LOW_GAS_FLOOR_FACTOR  5.0e3  Low gas floor factor (Athena default 5e3)
DUST_TVCAP_VRATIO_OVERRIDE  8.0  Force cap when |v_d|/|v_g| exceeds this
DUST_TVCAP_MACH_OVERRIDE     8.0  Force cap when |v_d|/cs exceeds this
DUST_TVCAP_Z_HG_RATIO        3.0  Altitude threshold (in scale heights) for override
DUST_VCAP_FLAG      0      Enable near-planet velocity cap (0=off, 1=on)
DUST_VCAP_FACTOR    2.0    Free-fall cap factor
DUST_VCAP_RADIUS_RATIO 0.1  Planet Hill radius fraction for cap region

### Planet parameters

PlanetConfig        planets/modelB_J3e-4.cfg
RocheSmoothing          0.10
Eccentricity            0.0
IndirectTerm            yes

### Mesh parameters
Nx                      1024
Ny                      320
Nz                      256

Xmin                    -3.14159265358979323844
Xmax                     3.14159265358979323844

Ymin                    0.3
Ymax                    2.3

# test-only vertical box: pi/2 +/- 0.15
Zmin                    1.420796326794897
Zmax                    1.720796326794897

Spacing                 N

# tighter azimuthal refinement around phi=0
XMA                     0.06
XMB                     0.12
XMC                     6.0

# tighter radial refinement around r=1
YMY0                    1.0
YMA                     0.06
YMB                     0.14
YMC                     12.0

Disk            YES
OmegaFrame     		1.0
Frame			G

### Damping
DampingZone     1.2
TauDamp         0.1

### Output control parameters
CFL         0.3
DT			0.314159265359	Time step length
Ninterm	 		100		Time steps between outputs
Ntot			30000		Total number of time steps

FuncArchFile    setups/3D_01rH/func_arch.cfg
OutputDir		@outputs/3D_01rH